# The S24 mouse mode's touchpad (s24-mouse-moded; Claude, 2026-11-15) is the whole screen: tell
# libinput it is external, so it does no edge palm detection or disable-while-typing on it.
ACTION=="add|change", KERNEL=="event*", ATTRS{name}=="S24 mouse mode touchpad", ENV{ID_INPUT_TOUCHPAD_INTEGRATION}="external"
